    <section class="plan_highlight student_explore_overview">
<article class="container">
<h2>Understanding &quot;Student Explore&quot;</h2>

<ul class="student_explore_content">
	<li><img src="https://cms.careinsurance.com/cms/public/assets/media/student-explore-1.webp" /></li>
	<li>
	<p>Here&rsquo;s why student travel insurance is a necessity. Studying abroad at top international universities opens the avenues for a bright future and offers a diversified learning experience. However, even after meticulously planning, international travel sometimes has unforeseen surprises! Therefore, to secure your journey towards your career goals, we offer- Student Explore Travel Insurance. Our customised travel insurance plans are explicitly designed for aspiring students who want to study abroad for a prolonged duration. It covers medical and non-medical risks such as emergency hospitalisation, personal accident, study interruption, loss of baggage, passport, medical evacuation, and much more.</p>

	<p>So, give wings to your dreams and acclimatise yourself to a new culture and country worry-free!</p>
	</li>
</ul>
</article>
</section>


          <section class="plan_highlight plan_details">
<article class="container">
<h2>Plan Details</h2>

<ul class="tabs">
	<li class="chi_tab_nav active">Policy Terms</li>
	<li class="chi_tab_nav">Exclusions</li>
</ul>

<aside class="tab_content what_covered" style="">
<h3>Policy Duration</h3>

<p class="tab_content_inner"><span>Minimum</span> <span>1 Month</span></p>

<p class="tab_content_inner"><span>Maximum</span> <span>24 months</span></p>

<h3>Eligible Relationship</h3>

<p class="tab_content_inner"><span>Eligible Relationship with the Insured (Student)</span> <span>Self (Student Only), legally married spouse, up to 2 dependent children, The policy is available on an individual basis.</span></p>

<h3>Scope of Coverage</h3>

<p class="tab_content_inner"><span>Coverage</span> <span>Worldwide Including USA &amp; Canada, Worldwide Excluding USA &amp; Canada, Coverage shall be extended to India Under Benefits: -Benefit 1= Extended Cover in the Country of Residence, -Benefit 2= Coverage in the Home Country</span></p>
</aside>

<aside class="tab_content what_covered" style="display: none;">
<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<ul>
	<li>Experimental, investigational or unproven treatments which are not consistent with or incidental to the diagnosis and treatment of the positive existence or presence of any Illness for which confinement is required at a Hospital</li>
	<li>Treatment of all external Congenital Anomalies or Illnesses or defects or anomalies or treatment relating to external birth defects.</li>
	<li>Any sporting activities involve training or participation in competitions of professional or semi-professional sports persons.</li>
	<li>Any claim relating to Hazardous Activities.</li>
	<li>Any claim relating to aviation training.</li>
	<li>Non-allopathic treatment.</li>
	<li>Illness or Injury attributable to the consumption, use, or misuse of intoxicating drugs or alcohol.</li>
	<li>War (whether declared or not) and war-like occurrences or invasions, acts of foreign enemies, hostilities, civil war, rebellion, revolutions, insurrections, mutiny, military or usurped power, seizure, capture, arrest, restraints, and detainment of all kinds.</li>
</ul>
</aside>
